01:04:54.657 --> 01:04:56.892
So what we put together is
something a little new -- if you

01:04:56.892 --> 01:04:58.894
could switch to -- it's
already on the tablet.

01:04:58.894 --> 01:05:02.865
So I'm going to be showing 4K
video using conference Wi-Fi

01:05:02.865 --> 01:05:05.234
from a tablet.

01:05:05.234 --> 01:05:08.571
What could go wrong?

01:05:08.571 --> 01:05:09.572
