01:06:40.262 --> 01:06:41.831
and it's like you're there.

01:06:41.831 --> 01:06:44.433
As close as we
can get you there.

01:06:44.433 --> 01:06:48.070
So you'll all receive a Google
Cardboard tonight at the party.

01:06:48.070 --> 01:06:50.072
We've got one for
