02:17:50.061 --> 02:17:52.330
Things like deep learning and
put directly in the hands of

02:17:52.330 --> 02:17:54.332
developers that never would
have been able to access that

02:17:54.332 --> 02:17:56.134
technology in the past.

02:17:56.134 --> 02:17:58.870
So we really want you to take
advantage of the next two days,

02:17:58.870 --> 02:17:59.871
